    "detailed_description": "Slumpunk is a multiplayer online TPS game set in the 22nd century. In this shooting game decorated with a cyberpunk theme, we offer a &quot;fast&quot; game full of adrenaline and action. It is a great game that is constantly growing with updates, improvements and developments.<br />\r\nHow about joining the adventure?<br />\r\nFire! Lets go.<br />\r\nOnline PvP and PVE team battles,<br />\r\nThe most popular FPS/TPS and Battle Royale game models,<br />\r\nGun Race, Elimination, Capture the Flag, Cover Point, Team Death Match.<br />\r\nPlayer and Weapon customization,<br />\r\nIn-game Shopping Store,<br />\r\nClan System,<br />\r\nPlayer Level System<br />\r\nClass System,<br />\r\n... and many more features to be added.",
